    "description": "Kanematsu Corporation trades in commercial products in Japan and internationally. It operates through Electronics; Foods, Meat; Steel Materials; and Motor Vehicles & Aerospace segments. The company offers semiconductor equipment, semiconductor and devices, industrial electronics, electronics components and materials, ICT solutions, mobile, and CCTV systems, as well as data, AI, and SaaS. It also provides cooked and processed foods; processed and agricultural products; meat products; grain, food soyabeans, and oilseeds; feedstuff; and agricultural, marine, beverage products, etc. In addition, the company trades in steel, steel tubing, chemicals, energy, plant and ships, and machine tools and industrial machinery products. The Motor Vehicles & Aerospace segment trades in motor vehicle and parts, and aerospace parts. Further, it manufactures and sells medium-density fiberboard; and sale of pet food, feed materials, feed by-products, soft drink to vending machine, metal products, formulated resin, and aircraft engines. Additionally, it is involved in the insurance agency and forwarding business, consigned freight forwarding business, and logistics services, as well as operates warehouse and self-storage. Kanematsu Corporation was founded in 1889 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan."
